language design-core version 0.5.
container KittyHost.
feature ManualWorkspaceResume.
unit NativeSessionCodec.
functionality RememberSavedPath.
usecase RestoreWorkspace.
functionality RestoreWorkspaceState.
mode Restoring.
unit ResumePicker.
functionality SaveWorkspace.
unit SavedSessionCatalog.
mode Saving.
functionality SelectWorkspace.
interface SessionFilePort.
actor TerminalUser.
KittyHost contains NativeSessionCodec.
KittyHost contains ResumePicker.
KittyHost contains SavedSessionCatalog.
ManualWorkspaceResume supports RestoreWorkspace.
NativeSessionCodec consumes SessionFilePort.
NativeSessionCodec owns RestoreWorkspaceState.
NativeSessionCodec owns SaveWorkspace.
RememberSavedPath allocated-to KittyHost in mode Saving.
RememberSavedPath contributes-to ManualWorkspaceResume.
RestoreWorkspaceState allocated-to KittyHost in mode Restoring.
RestoreWorkspaceState contributes-to ManualWorkspaceResume.
ResumePicker owns SelectWorkspace.
SaveWorkspace allocated-to KittyHost in mode Saving.
